{"packetId":"packet-req-1-1-1","cases":[{"id":"register-account-happy-path","requirementIds":["REQ-1-1-1"],"purpose":"happy_path","expectationBasis":["The visitor enters a unique username, email, password, and matching confirmation, checks “Agree to the terms”, and activates “Create account”.","A successful registration accepts a unique username such as “pw-user-<unique suffix>”, its “@example.test” email, and password “Valid-password-123!”; the sign-in form is immediately available, accepts that email, and the resulting signed-in username remains visible after reload."],"steps":[{"op":"goto","path":"/"},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Sign in","exact":true,"fallbacks":[{"by":"role","role":"button","name":"Sign in","exact":true}]}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Create an account","exact":true,"fallbacks":[{"by":"role","role":"button","name":"Create an account","exact":true}]}},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Username","exact":true},"value":"pw-user-1k9"},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Email","exact":true},"value":"pw-user-1k9@example.test"},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Password","exact":true},"value":"Valid-password-123!"},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Confirm password","exact":true},"value":"Valid-password-123!"},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Agree to the terms","exact":true}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"button","name":"Create account","exact":true}},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Email","exact":true},"value":"pw-user-1k9@example.test"},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Password","exact":true},"value":"Valid-password-123!"},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Sign in","exact":true,"fallbacks":[{"by":"role","role":"button","name":"Sign in","exact":true}]}},{"op":"reload"},{"op":"expectVisible","locator":{"by":"text","text":"pw-user-1k9","exact":true,"fallbacks":[{"by":"text"